sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Admin
    participant CLI as rhaii-validator CLI<br/>(kubectl plugin)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant CheckPod as Check Job Pod<br/>(Privileged)
    participant HostGPU as Host GPU<br/>(nvidia-smi / rocm-smi)
    participant ServerPod as Server Job Pod<br/>(validator-tools)
    participant ClientPod as Client Job Pod<br/>(validator-tools)
    participant CM as ConfigMap<br/>(Report)

    Note over User,CM: Flow 1: GPU Hardware Validation

    User->>CLI: kubectl rhaii-validate check
    CLI->>K8sAPI: Create Namespace, SA, RBAC<br/>HTTPS/6443 TLS 1.2+
    CLI->>K8sAPI: List Nodes (GPU labels)<br/>Bearer Token
    K8sAPI-->>CLI: Node list with GPU resources
    CLI->>K8sAPI: Create Check Job per node
    K8sAPI->>CheckPod: Schedule on GPU node

    CheckPod->>HostGPU: chroot /host nvidia-smi<br/>(privileged container)
    HostGPU-->>CheckPod: GPU driver version, ECC errors,<br/>PCIe topology
    CheckPod->>CheckPod: Check /sys/class/infiniband<br/>/sys/bus/pci/devices

    CLI->>K8sAPI: Read pod logs (JSON on stdout)
    K8sAPI-->>CLI: Structured check results
    CLI->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ConfigMap
    K8sAPI->>CM: Store JSON report

    Note over User,CM: Flow 2: RDMA Bandwidth Test (Ring Topology)

    CLI->>K8sAPI: Create Server Job<br/>(ib_write_bw --server)
    K8sAPI->>ServerPod: Schedule on target node
    ServerPod->>ServerPod: Listen on 18515+/TCP<br/>(RDMA port)
    CLI->>K8sAPI: Get Server Pod IP
    K8sAPI-->>CLI: Pod IP address

    Note over CLI: Wait 3s for server readiness

    CLI->>K8sAPI: Create Client Job<br/>(ib_write_bw --connect=<server-ip>)
    K8sAPI->>ClientPod: Schedule on peer node
    ClientPod->>ServerPod: ib_write_bw<br/>18515+/TCP RDMA (IB/RoCE)<br/>GPUDirect RDMA

    ClientPod-->>CLI: Bandwidth results (pod logs)
    CLI->>K8sAPI: Update ConfigMap
    K8sAPI->>CM: Append bandwidth report

    Note over User,CM: Flow 3: TCP Bandwidth Test (iperf3)

    CLI->>K8sAPI: Create Server Job (iperf3 -s)
    K8sAPI->>ServerPod: Schedule on target node
    ServerPod->>ServerPod: Listen on 5201/TCP
    CLI->>K8sAPI: Create Client Job (iperf3 -c)
    K8sAPI->>ClientPod: Schedule on peer node
    ClientPod->>ServerPod: iperf3<br/>5201/TCP plaintext
    ClientPod-->>CLI: TCP bandwidth results

    Note over User,CM: Flow 4: RDMA Connectivity (Pingmesh)

    CLI->>K8sAPI: Create pairwise Jobs<br/>(ibv_rc_pingpong, N-choose-2)
    K8sAPI->>ServerPod: Schedule disjoint pairs
    K8sAPI->>ClientPod: Schedule disjoint pairs
    ClientPod->>ServerPod: ibv_rc_pingpong<br/>18515+/TCP RDMA
    ClientPod-->>CLI: Connectivity results

    CLI->>K8sAPI: Cleanup Jobs, RBAC
    CLI-->>User: Validation report (table/JSON)
